---
import '../../styles/coverage.css';
import OutlineIcon from '../shared/OutlineIcon.astro';
---

<section class="coverage-section section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered">
      <p class="label muted">What parents will learn</p>
      <h2 id="outcomes">What you will be able to decide after this webinar</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="coverage-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="compass" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Science, Commerce or Arts?</h3>
        <p>Learn how to evaluate stream fit beyond marks and peer pressure.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="triangle-alert" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Is your child choosing from clarity or fear?</h3>
        <p>Understand the difference between genuine interest and pressure-driven selection.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="brain" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Which strengths need deeper assessment?</h3>
        <p>Know when a child may need a structured aptitude and personality evaluation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="heart-handshake" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3>How should parents discuss careers?</h3>
        <p>Learn how to talk about careers without creating panic, conflict or resistance.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="triangle-alert" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">05</span>
        </div>
        <h3>What mistakes should be avoided?</h3>
        <p>Understand common parent mistakes during Class 9 and Class 10 stream decisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-topline">
          <span class="feature-icon"><OutlineIcon name="badge-check" size={18} /></span>
          <span class="feature-index">06</span>
        </div>
        <h3>What is the next practical step?</h3>
        <p>Walk away with a clearer roadmap for your child’s stream and career exploration.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
